# Maintainer: Yūrei Linux project
# Yūrei's own recipe (stage 3, the desktop; docs/INDEPENDENT.md). The source
# address and sum are the ones in independent/bootstrap/sources.lock;
# check-recipes.py keeps them the same.
pkgname=glslang
_lockname=glslang
pkgver=15.3.0
pkgrel=1
pkgdesc="GLSL to SPIR-V shader compiler (glslangValidator)"
arch=(x86_64)
url="https://github.com/KhronosGroup/glslang"
license=(BSD-3-Clause)
depends=(glibc gcc-libs spirv-tools)
source=("https://github.com/KhronosGroup/glslang/archive/$pkgver/glslang-$pkgver.tar.gz")
sha256sums=('PIN')

build() {
    cmake -S glslang-$pkgver -B build -G Ninja -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release \
        -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr -DBUILD_SHARED_LIBS=ON -DALLOW_EXTERNAL_SPIRV_TOOLS=ON \
        -DGLSLANG_TESTS=OFF -DENABLE_OPT=ON
    ninja -C build
}

package() {
    DESTDIR="$pkgdir" ninja -C build install
}
